### Test if API is running
GET http://localhost:3001

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:3001/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Learn API basics"
}

### Update a task (replace TASK_ID with actual ID from create response)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/tasks/TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Updated task text",
  "completed": true
}

### Delete a task (replace TASK_ID with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/tasks/TASK_ID

### Start a focus session
POST http://localhost:3001/api/timer/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "duration": 25,
  "type": "focus"
}

### Complete a timer session (replace SESSION_ID with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/timer/SESSION_ID/complete

### Get timer statistics
GET http://localhost:3001/api/timer/stats
